-# GIS Cup visibility solver — scheduled restricted multi-swap
+# GIS Cup visibility solver — parallel large-cache preparation and anchor expansion
 
 This project keeps the fast exact-boundary local CDT walk, visibility-induced candidates, polygon-epoch hot-candidate 1-swap search, anchor-expanded restricted CP-SAT, final polishing, and live plotting.
 
